WEBVTT

00:01:29.497 --> 00:01:31.697
at Georgia State University,

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:35.530
and our students are building
the metaverse as I speak.

00:01:36.863 --> 00:01:40.597
We imagine a future where the students
and all digital artists

00:01:40.597 --> 00:01:44.530
are able to continue building
new visions and new worlds --

00:01:45.263 --> 00:01:46.997
basically, a better internet --

00:01:47.597 --> 00:01:50.163
and can make a living while doing so.

00:01:50.197 --> 00:01:52.330
The revolutionary instrument

00:01:52.363 --> 00:01:57.830
that allowed for a digital file
to be sold as a unique artwork

00:01:57.863 --> 00:02:00.063
for 69 million dollars